      'At Badr the Prophet consulted: O people, advise me. Abu Bakr and Umar spoke well; Miqdad pledged Muhajir loyalty — we will not say as Israel said to Musa, go you and your Lord and fight; we fight beside you. Then Sad ibn Muadh pledged the Ansar: march where you will — we are with you, patient in war, truthful in meeting. Faces lit; the march continued on pledged hearts.',
